{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20574","headline":"送李司空赴镇襄阳 · 张籍","name":"送李司空赴镇襄阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中外兼权社稷臣，千官齐出拜行尘。\n再调公鼎勳庸盛，三受兵符宠命新。\n商路雪开旗斾展，楚堤梅发驿亭春。\n襄阳风景由来好，重与江山作主人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}